= Toni Sennet

Toni Sennet is an organizer and writer who came from a bourgeois family, but was radicalized into <span style="color: #c00000;">socialism</span> after her experiences in the workforce. She was a member of the anti-war <span style="color: #D47B9B;">**USPD**</span>, but did not support armed revolution.

